- 지원: GitHub 일반 repo Markdown folder; non-GitHub ZIP/multi-file UTF-8 Markdown/text export bundle.
- 미지원: GitHub `.wiki.git`, Notion/Confluence/Google Drive live connector, PDF/DOCX/HTML/CSV/이미지 본문 해석.
